  "differences_from_the_gateway": [
    "The gateway ingests /source and /rust-mcp-vendor into tmpfs volumes from a SourceBundle and a CargoVendorSnapshot; this capture bind-mounts fixtures/bloat read-only and an empty staged directory as the vendor, because the fixture has no external dependencies. Same guest paths, same read-only mode.",
    "The gateway creates each container with `docker container create` and then compares everything the daemon applied against what the phase asked for (verify_applied). This capture uses `docker run` and performs no such re-inspection.",
    "The gateway carves each phase's deadline out of BLOAT_BUDGET_MS after a control reserve; this capture gives each container the whole 300 s budget as a timeout.",
    "The three negative cases are not product paths: bloat_arguments can never emit --profile, the product never sets CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_STRIP, and BloatOptions validates the target name."
  ],
